Title:  The universe is queerer than we can suppose

Seq:    12.6.71.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Haldane, J. B. S.|J. B. S. Haldane]], 1927, from the book *[[Possible Worlds and Other Essays]]*

Timestamp: 20251217212640

Date Added: 2025-12-17 14:26:40 -0700

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: First and last, there is wonder

Body:

Now, my own suspicion is that the universe is not only queerer than we suppose, but queerer than we *can* suppose.

